===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|arborētum||place with trees growing, plantation of trees}}, from {{m|la|arbor||tree}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɑː(ɹ)bəˈɹiːtəm/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|arboreta}}

# A place where many [[variety|varieties]] of [[tree]] are grown for [[research]], [[educational]], and [[ornamental]] purposes.
#: {{cot|en|floretum}}

